                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "23.05 All regular full time employees shall be eligible to receive one (1) additional personal holiday, namely, the employee's Anniversary Date of Employment, with eight (8) hours straight time pay for said holiday.",
